## Original Content
语义、关键词、全文和图谱检索各自覆盖不同问法。多路结果汇入候选池后再统一重排，可以把“有没有找到”和“应该排在哪里”分开检查，减少调参时的盲区。

## Summary
This article introduces ZGI hybrid retrieval, which combines semantic, keyword, full-text, and graph retrieval methods. Results are aggregated into a candidate pool for unified reranking, separating retrieval and ranking to improve parameter tuning and reduce blind spots.

## Key Points
- Hybrid retrieval methods cover different query aspects.
- Results are gathered into a candidate pool before reranking.
- Unified reranking separates the processes of finding and ranking.
- This approach reduces blind spots during parameter tuning.


